$DATUM N-(((3S,3aS)-7-(6-cyanopyridin-3-yl)-1-oxo-1,3,3a,4-tetrahydrobenzo[b]oxazolo[3,4-d][1,4]oxazin-3-yl)methyl)acetamide
(45). A mixture of 33a (50 mg, 0.147 mmol),
5-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)picolinonitrile1 (40.5 mg,
0.176 mmol), 2 N potassium fluoride (0.15mL, 0.30 mmol) and
tetrakis(triphenylphosphine)palladium(0) (17 mg, 0.015 mmol) in dioxane
(5 mL) was degassed and flushed with argon. The mixture was hearted to
reflux for 2 h. Dichloromethane/methanol (10:1, 50 mL) was added, and the
mixture was filtered, washed with water, saturated brine, dried over
sodium sulfate, and evaporated. The residue was purified by
chromatography on silica gel with dichloromethane /methanol (50:1) to
give 45. White solid, yield 35 mg, 65%. Mp: 230-231 °C. 1H NMR (300 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 8.90 (d, J = 0.80 Hz, 1 H), 8.16 (d, J = 8.21 Hz, 1 H), 7.96
(dd, J1 = 2.20 Hz, J2 = 8.07 Hz, 1 H), 7.76 (dd, J1 = 0.80 Hz, J2 = 8.21
Hz, 1 H), 7.22 (m, 2 H), 6.17 (t, J = 6.13 Hz, 1 H), 4.62 (dd, J1 = 2.64
Hz, J2 = 10.06 Hz, 1 H), 4.48 (m, 1 H), 4.08 (dd, J1 = 2.63 Hz, J2 = 7.03
Hz, 1 H), 3.94 (t, J = 10.12 Hz, 1 H), 3.76 (m, 2 H), 2.07 (s, 3 H). 13C
NMR (100 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 170.2, 153.2, 149.0, 144.6, 138.0, 134.9,
130.9, 130.8, 129.1, 124.7, 120.3, 118.7, 117.7, 115.5, 74.9, 65.8, 53.0,
40.4, 22.5. MS (ESI) m/z: 365.2 (M+1)+. HRMS (ESI): Anal. Calcd for
C19H16N4O4Na: 387.1069, Found: 387.1081.
