$DATUM 3,3,3',3'-tetrahexyl-3,3',4,4'-tetrahydro-2H,2'H-6,6'-bithieno[3,4-b][1,4]dioxepine-8-carb
aldehyde (5c) The stirred mixture of 2c (4.73 g, 10.5 mmol), 4b (3.02 g,
7.0 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (0.086 g, 0.385 mmol), PPh3 (0.40 g, 1.54 mmol),
KF·2H2O (2.64 g, 28.0 mmol), DME (70 mL) and H2O (3.5 mL) was refluxed
for 42 h and then concentrated in vacuo. The residue was partitioned
between EtOAc and H2O, then the organic layer was evaporated.
Purification by column chromatography (toluene-PE 3:7) gave 5b (2.95 g,
63%) as a yellow oil. Rf = 0.31 (1% EtOAc in toluene-PE 3:17); IR (film)
νmax 3283, 3107, 2924, 2857, 2730, 2250, 1978, 1648, 1570, 1547, 1501,
1432, 1373, 1268, 1228, 1174, 1131, 1034, 893, 857, 802, 752, 725, 674,
606, 588, 403 cm-1; 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.90 (s, 1H), 6.47 (s, 1H),
4.04 (s, 2H), 3.97 (s, 4H), 3.83 (s, 2H), 1.40-1.37 (m, 8H), 1.28 (br,
32H), 0.88 (br, 12H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 181.0, 156.0, 149.4,
147.8, 143.9, 126.2, 118.2, 113.8, 106.2, 78.1, 77.8, 77.2, 43.8, 32.1,
31.9, 31.8, 30.2, 30.1, 22.85, 22.81, 22.7, 14.1; HRMS cald for
C39H63O5S2 [M+H]+ : 675.4117, found 675.4115.
